sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User
    participant UI as User Interface (React)
    participant Core as Core OS Engine (Tauri/Rust)
    participant AG as Agent Gateway (MCP)
    participant LLM as Ollama / Local Model

    User->>UI: Triggers CMD+K "Draft Weekly Review"
    UI->>Core: Request last 7 days of unified logs (finances, sleep, habits)
    Core->>Core: Fetch from SQLite & Parse Markdown Vault
    Core-->>UI: Return raw weekly dataset (low sensitivity)
    UI->>Core: Request context-aware retrospective prompt
    Core->>AG: Construct prompt payload & Apply Context Masking
    Note over AG: High sensitivity data scrubbed/tokenized locally
    AG->>LLM: Send anonymized Weekly Reflection prompt
    LLM-->>AG: Return drafted Weekly Review & correlation report
    AG->>Core: Forward raw review draft
    Core->>Core: Save weekly review markdown draft to Vault
    Core-->>UI: Push draft status & correlation details
    UI-->>User: Render fully drafted Weekly Note (ready for manual final edit)
